## PRODUCTS SECTION

### ScanWise - Document Intelligence & Text Extraction

**Tagline:** Turn Every Document Into Structured Data

**Description:**
ScanWise is an AI-powered text extraction and document intelligence platform that transforms unstructured paper documents into clean, searchable, actionable data. Whether you're dealing with contracts, case files, invoices, forms, or handwritten notes, ScanWise automatically extracts key information and structures it for immediate use.

**Key Features:**
- Intelligent text extraction from any document format (PDF, images, scans, handwritten)
- Automatic field recognition and data structuring
- Multi-language support across African languages and English
- Document classification and categorization
- Batch processing for large document volumes
- API integration for seamless workflow automation
- OCR technology optimized for low-quality scans
- Customizable extraction templates for industry-specific documents

**Use Cases:**
- Extract client information from intake forms
- Automate contract data entry
- Digitize property deeds and registrations
- Process permit applications automatically
- Extract invoice data for accounting
- Capture supplier information from documents

**Current Status:** Ready for Law Firms | Early Access

